# JustAC local pin: upstream ships no SimulationCraft list for this spec. A damage priority
# for a Holy Paladin filling gaps between heals, grounded at client build 12.1.0.69875.
# Shield of the Righteous is the only Holy Power damage spender (Word of Glory and Light of
# Dawn are heals and never reach the damage queue); it is spent at 4+ so the next builder
# never overcaps, and each cast also shortens Holy Shock. Hammer of Wrath only exists while
# Avenging Wrath turns Judgment into it, and Crusader Strike only while Avenging Crusader
# replaces itself with it, so both lines are simply skipped otherwise. Avenging Wrath,
# Avenging Crusader and Holy Armaments are raid cooldowns or ally buffs and are left to the
# player. Lightsmith cashes in Divine Guidance stacks with Consecration; Righteous Judgment
# builds let Judgment place Consecration instead of hard-casting it in single target.

actions=shield_of_the_righteous,if=holy_power>=4
actions+=/hammer_of_wrath
actions+=/consecration,if=active_enemies>=3
actions+=/divine_toll,if=active_enemies>=3
actions+=/holy_prism
actions+=/crusader_strike
actions+=/judgment
actions+=/holy_shock
actions+=/consecration,if=talent.divine_guidance&buff.divine_guidance.stack>=3
actions+=/consecration,if=!talent.righteous_judgment
